/P 67 0 R
/E (The name Legislative Council was changed in 1962 to the House of Representatives and in 1970 the name changed to Parliament. the name National Assembly and National Assembly Members was used in 1997. The change of name was due to Constitutional developments of the country.)
/Pg 11 0 R
